# Data restrictions
| Attribute | C# Data type | Restrictions |
|---|---|---|
|| <center>**Boss**</center> ||
| BossId | int | PK |
| SummonItemId | int | NULLABLE FK, SetNull delete |
| BossName | string | not empty, max length = 50, UNIQUE |
| BossSprite | string | not empty, max length = 500, UNIQUE |
|| <center>**BossPart**</center> ||
| BossPartId | int | PK |
| BossId | int | NOT NULL FK, Cascade delete |
| EntityId | int | NOT NULL FK, Restrict delete |
| BossPartOrderId | short | 0 <= BossPartOrderId <= 5, UNIQUE |
| Quantity | short | Quantity > 0 |
|| <center>**BossPartStage**</center> ||
| BossPartStageId | int | PK |
| BossPartId | int | NOT NULL FK, Cascade delete |
| BossPartStageSprite | string | not empty, max length = 500 |
| BossPartStageOrderId | short | 0 <= BossPartStageOrderId <= 3, UNIQUE |
| ContactDamage | short | ContactDamage >= 0 |
| Hp | short | Hp >= 0 |
| Defense | short | Defense >= 0 |
|| <center>**Enemy**</center> ||
| EnemyId | int | PK |
| EntityId | int | NOT NULL FK, Cascade delete |
| ContactDamage | short | ContactDamage >= 0 |
| Hp | short | Hp >= 0 |
| Defense | short | Defense >= 0 |
|| <center>**Entity**</center> ||
| EntityId | int | PK |
| InternalNpcId | short | UNIQUE |
| EntityName | string | not empty, max length = 50 |
| Description | string | max length = 200 |
|| <center>**TownNpc**</center> ||
| TownNpcId | int | PK |
| EntityId | int | NOT NULL FK, Cascade delete |
| Hp | short | Hp >= 0 |
| Defense | short | Defense >= 0 |
|| <center>**TownNpcForm**</center> ||
| TownNpcFormId | int | PK |
| TownNpcId | int | NOT NULL FK, Cascade delete |
| TownNpcFormSprite | string | not empty, max length = 500, UNIQUE |
| TownNpcFormOrderId | short | 0 <= TownNpcFormOrderId <= 4, UNIQUE |
|| <center>**Item**</center> ||
| ItemId | int | PK |
| CraftingStationId | int | NULLABLE FK, SetNull delete |
| InternalItemId | short | UNIQUE |
| ItemName | string | not empty, max length = 50, UNIQUE |
| BuyPrice | int | BuyPrice >= 0 |
| SellPrice | int | SellPrice >= 0 |
| BuyPriceCurrency | Currency | not empty, max length = 50 |
|| <center>**ItemForm**</center> ||
| ItemFormId | int | PK |
| ItemId | int | NOT NULL FK, Cascade delete |
| ItemSprite | string | not empty, max length = 500, UNIQUE |
| ItemFormOrderId | short | 0 <= ItemFormOrderId <= 4, UNIQUE |
| Tooltip | string | max length = 200 |
|| <center>**CraftingStation**</center> ||
| CraftingStationId | int | PK |
| CraftingStationName | string | not empty, max length = 50, UNIQUE |
| CraftingStationSprite | string | not empty, max length = 500, UNIQUE |
|| <center>**Recipe**</center> ||
| RecipeId | int | PK |
| ResultItemId | int | NOT NULL FK, Restrict delete |
| CraftingStationId | int | NULLABLE FK, SetNull delete |
| ResultItemQuantity | short | ResultItemQuantity > 0 |
|| <center>**BossDrop**</center> ||
| BossDropId | int | PK |
| BossId | int | NOT NULL FK, Cascade delete |
| ItemId | int | NOT NULL FK, Restrict delete |
| Quantity | short | Quantity > 0 |
|| <center>**BossPartStageEnemies**</center> ||
| BossPartStageEnemiesId | int | PK |
| BossPartStageId | int | NOT NULL FK, Cascade delete |
| EnemyId | int | NOT NULL FK, Restrict delete |
| Quantity | short | Quantity > 0 |
|| <center>**EntityDrop**</center> ||
| EntityDropId | int | PK |
| EntityId | int | NOT NULL FK, Cascade delete |
| ItemId | int | NOT NULL FK, Restrict delete |
| Quantity | short | Quantity > 0 |
|| <center>**TradeOffer**</center> ||
| TradeOfferId | int | PK |
| TownNpcId | int | NOT NULL FK, Cascade delete |
| ItemId | int | NOT NULL FK, Restrict delete |
| Quantity | short | Quantity > 0 |
| TradeType | TradeType | not empty, max length = 50 |
|| <center>**RecipeItems**</center> ||
| RecipeItemsId | int | PK |
| RecipeId | int | NOT NULL FK, Cascade delete |
| ItemId | int | NOT NULL FK, Restrict delete |
| Quantity | short | Quantity > 0 |

